<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - HongkongBank Australia profit jumps 141.5 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS - HongkongBank Australia profit jumps 141.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSBC Holdings Plc unit HongkongBank of Australia Ltd said attributable net profit jumped 141.5 percent to A$31.4 million in calendar 1996 from A$13.0 million in 1995.</p>
<p>The bank said it increased the net profit of its personal and corporate banking and trade finance divisions in the year. Its stockbroking and asset management arms also improved.</p>
<p>Total assets grew by 12.6 percent to A$4.02 billion from A$3.57 billion. The bank said its Tier One capital ratio was 9.3 percent and its risk asset ratio was 10.3 percent at end-1996.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
